Value Required NAME (\S+)
Value RD (\S+)
Value CREATED (\d{4}/\d{2}/\d{2}\s+\d{2}:\d{2}:\d{2})

# One record per VPN instance (vpn-fabric lab and VSR, Comware 7.1): the count and
# license lines, then name, RD and creation time.
Start
  ^\s*Total VPN-Instances configured\s*:\s*\d+\s*$$
  ^\s*License limit\s*:\s*\S+\s*$$
  ^\s*Max VPN instances permitted by license\s*:\s*\d+\s*$$
  ^\s*VPN-Instance Name\s+RD\s+Create time\s*$$
  ^\s*${NAME}\s+${RD}\s+${CREATED}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized display ip vpn-instance line"
